Pin per-branch state dir; keep kick tokens shared

The dev/start scripts set WORLDSTREAM_STATE_DIR=state/build-the-rocket so
the mission save no longer sits in the state/ root shared by every
branch-project. Kick tokens move to the shared state/ root: refresh
tokens rotate, so per-branch copies would invalidate each other.

